license-file:
added:        2026-09-30 by Claude (agent) for Brandon Thomas
notes:        Crop of the color grading panel (Basic Correction, Color Wheels) while grading Charade (1963); shows panel controls only. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1). Contains no Adobe artwork.
Media visible in the screenshot (none of it is committed to the repository):
  - Night of the Living Dead (1968), dir. George A. Romero, Image Ten. US public domain (released without a copyright notice). Source: https://archive.org/details/night-of-the-living-dead-1968-english (Public Domain Mark).
  - Carnival of Souls (1962), dir. Herk Harvey, Harcourt Productions. US public domain. Source: https://archive.org/details/CarnivalOfSoulsVideoQualityUpgrade (Public Domain Mark).
  - Charade (1963), dir. Stanley Donen, Universal. US public domain (defective copyright notice). Source: https://archive.org/details/charade-1963-cary-grant-audrey-hepburn-comedy-mystery-romance-thriller-full-movie (Public Domain Mark).
  - Earth Views from the ISS (NASA, NHQ_2020_1221, no-music edition). US Government work, public domain; NASA does not endorse this project. Source: https://images.nasa.gov/details/NHQ_2020_1221_Earth%20Views
  - Chopin, Nocturne Op. 48 No. 1 and Ballade No. 1, performed for Musopen. CC0-1.0. Source: https://archive.org/details/musopen-chopin (shown only as waveforms).
